# --- Secrets / credentials (never commit) ---
# `.env*` is a PREFIX glob: .env, .envrc, .env.local. `*.env` is a SUFFIX
# glob: audit.env, production.env. Neither implies the other, and `.env.*`
# (the old form here) missed .envrc outright. The negation must stay BELOW
# both patterns, or the committed example file stops being tracked.
.env*
*.env
!.env.example
secrets/
credentials*
*.pem
*.key

# --- Logs & databases ---
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# --- Dependencies / build output ---
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Local tool state ---
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Personal scratch (not published) ---
/POSSIBLE-ADDITIONS.md
*.scratch.md
